<title>USA: Ohio Highway Improvement bonds won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Ohio Highway Improvement bonds won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $125 million State of Ohio Highway Capital Improvement bonds, series B, with a net interest cost (NIC) of 4.66 percent.</p>
</text>
